abstract: >-
  Code for the agent-based emissions trading model and differential-evolution policy
  optimization interfaces associated with the accepted research article
  "Joint Optimization of Emission Caps and Auction Shares in Emissions Trading
  Systems: A Bi-Level Simulation-Optimization Approach", IEEE Transactions on
  Engineering Management. Experimental inputs, plotting and experiment scripts
  are excluded from this release.
